# SAMAUDIT – direct Python dependencies (input for the lock file requirements.txt).
#
# The image is built ONLY from requirements.txt: every package – including all sub-dependencies –
# with an exact version and SHA-256 hashes. tools/update-locks.sh computes it from this file.
# The weekly security update keeps every package within its major version (0.x: minor version);
# calendar versions (tzdata) have no limit. Minimum versions below exclude known-vulnerable releases.
